% Regression guard for the -BF 2 (Barfly) stress model on a bar longer than
% its time signature, here five bars of a reel with the bar lines left out.
% beat_modifier() (store.c) maps each note onto the segments of the stress
% pattern, 8 per bar of a reel:
% - the note velocities were read from ngain[32] at the segment number, so
%   from the fifth bar on past its end (global-buffer-overflow under the
%   sanitize build); before that, from the second bar on, the gain read was
%   0, so the notes lost the stress pattern for the plain beat velocities;
% - fdursum_at_segment() (genmidi.c) added the length of only one bar to
%   the positions after the first bar, so from the third bar on, positions
%   went back and some durations became negative, shifting all the notes
%   that follow.
% The stressed rendering is now the same as with the bar lines written:
% FAAB AFED|FAAB d2fe|dBAF ABde|fdec dBAF|ABde fd ed|
X:1
T:Barfly reel with the bar lines left out
C:abc2midi test
M:4/4
L:1/8
R:reel
K:D
FAAB AFED FAAB d2fe dBAF ABde fdec dBAF ABde fd ed|
